|               |             TableScan: date_dim projection=[d_date_sk, d_year, d_moy]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |         TableScan: store_sales projection=[ss_sold_date_sk, ss_item_sk, ss_ext_sales_price]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |       TableScan: item projection=[i_item_sk, i_category_id, i_category], full_filters=[item.i_manager_id = Int64(1)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| physical_plan | SortExec: TopK(fetch=100), expr=[sum(store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price)@3 DESC, d_year@0 ASC NULLS LAST, i_category_id@1 ASC NULLS LAST, i_category@2 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
